      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question. If the kernel driver is exposing iio, then why can\u0027t this use the intel iio hal already available on org?",
      "revId": "cf59e2aef656b590266a22b484bcb02d21081b5a",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
